# =============================================================================
# DETECTION: Brute-Force Login Attempts (Windows Security Event 4625)
# =============================================================================
# Author      : Shankar Baral
# Purpose     : Identify Top Attacker IPs targeting the Windows Server via
#               failed RDP / SMB / interactive logon attempts.
# Data Source : WinEventLog:Security
# Event Code  : 4625 (An account failed to log on)
# MITRE ATT&CK: T1110 - Brute Force
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Use Case    : SOC analysts can run this query to surface external threat
#               actors hammering the host with credential-guessing attacks.
# =============================================================================

index=* sourcetype="WinEventLog:Security" EventCode=4625
| stats count by Source_Network_Address, Account_Name, ComputerName
| sort - count
| rename count as "Failed_Login_Attempts"